## 4. SCHEMA DEFINITION

### 4.1 Fact Table — fact_order_item

> **Grain:** 1 row per product per order (one line item per receipt)

| Column         | Data Type      | Nullable   | Key        | Description                        |
|----------------|----------------|------------|------------|------------------------------------|
| order_id       | VARCHAR(45)    | NOT NULL   | PK         | Unique order line identifier       |
| customer_id    | BIGINT(8)      | NOT NULL   | FK         | FK → dim_customer.customer_id      |
| product_id     | VARCHAR(45)    | NOT NULL   | FK         | FK → dim_product.product_id        |
| promo_id       | VARCHAR(45)    | NULLABLE   | FK         | FK → dim_promotion.promo_id        |
| order_date_key | BIGINT(8)      | NOT NULL   | FK         | FK → dim_date.order_date_key       |
| quantity       | INT            | NOT NULL   | —          | Quantity of items ordered          |
| price          | DECIMAL(10,2)  | NOT NULL   | —          | Unit price in GBP                  |
| amount         | DECIMAL(10,2)  | NOT NULL   | —          | Total amount = quantity × price    |

### 4.2 Dimension Table — dim_customer

| Column         | Data Type      | Nullable   | Key        | Description                        |
|----------------|----------------|------------|------------|------------------------------------|
| customer_id    | BIGINT(8)      | NOT NULL   | PK         | Unique customer identifier         |
| customer_name  | VARCHAR(100)   | NOT NULL   | —          | Full customer name (SENSITIVE)     |
| email          | VARCHAR(100)   | NULLABLE   | —          | Customer email (SENSITIVE)         |
| region         | VARCHAR(50)    | NULLABLE   | —          | Customer region                    |
| segment        | VARCHAR(50)    | NULLABLE   | —          | Customer segment / type            |

### 4.3 Dimension Table — dim_product

| Column         | Data Type      | Nullable   | Key        | Description                        |
|----------------|----------------|------------|------------|------------------------------------|
| product_id     | VARCHAR(45)    | NOT NULL   | PK         | Unique product identifier          |
| product_name   | VARCHAR(45)    | NOT NULL   | —          | Product name                       |
| category       | VARCHAR(50)    | NULLABLE   | —          | Product category                   |
| sub_category   | VARCHAR(50)    | NULLABLE   | —          | Product sub-category               |
| price          | DECIMAL(10,2)  | NULLABLE   | —          | Standard product price in GBP      |

