## 5. DATA QUALITY RULES

| Rule ID | Table            | Field          | Rule                          | Threshold | Action on Breach     |
|---------|------------------|----------------|-------------------------------|-----------|----------------------|
| DQ-001  | fact_order_item  | order_id       | NOT NULL + UNIQUE             | 100%      | Pipeline fails       |
| DQ-002  | fact_order_item  | customer_id    | NOT NULL                      | 100%      | Pipeline fails       |
| DQ-003  | fact_order_item  | product_id     | NOT NULL                      | 100%      | Pipeline fails       |
| DQ-004  | fact_order_item  | order_date_key | NOT NULL                      | 100%      | Pipeline fails       |
| DQ-005  | fact_order_item  | quantity       | quantity > 0                  | 100%      | Pipeline fails       |
| DQ-006  | fact_order_item  | price          | price >= 0                    | 100%      | Pipeline fails       |
| DQ-007  | fact_order_item  | amount         | amount = quantity × price     | 100%      | Pipeline fails       |
| DQ-008  | fact_order_item  | customer_id    | Must exist in dim_customer    | 100%      | Pipeline fails       |
| DQ-009  | fact_order_item  | product_id     | Must exist in dim_product     | 100%      | Pipeline fails       |
| DQ-010  | fact_order_item  | order_date_key | Must exist in dim_date        | 100%      | Pipeline fails       |
| DQ-011  | fact_order_item  | Row count      | Minimum 100 rows per day      | 100%      | Alert fires          |
| DQ-012  | dim_customer     | customer_id    | NOT NULL + UNIQUE             | 100%      | Pipeline fails       |
| DQ-013  | dim_product      | product_id     | NOT NULL + UNIQUE             | 100%      | Pipeline fails       |

> Rule: If any DQ-001 to DQ-010 fails → pipeline halts immediately.
> No silent bad data. No partial loads. Ever.

