## 7. MEDALLION ARCHITECTURE LAYERS

| Layer      | DBFS Path                  | Purpose                                      | Write Mode  |
|------------|----------------------------|----------------------------------------------|-------------|
| Bronze     | /bronze/ecommerce/         | Raw CSV data as-is. Never modified.          | APPEND      |
| Silver     | /silver/ecommerce/         | Cleaned, typed, deduplicated, validated      | OVERWRITE   |
| Gold       | /gold/ecommerce/           | Star Schema — analytics ready                | OVERWRITE   |

### Contract Validation Per Layer

**Bronze Layer:**
- Schema matches source CSV format
- Ingestion timestamp recorded on every row
- Source file name recorded on every row
- No completely empty files accepted
- Raw data preserved exactly as received

**Silver Layer:**
- All DQ rules DQ-001 to DQ-013 applied
- Null checks on all NOT NULL fields
- Duplicate order_ids removed
- amount = quantity × price verified
- All FK references validated against dimensions
- Data types cast and enforced

**Gold Layer:**
- Star Schema fully built and validated
- Row counts reconcile with Silver layer
- All aggregations verified
- Data available by 04:00 UTC SLA
- Ready for BI consumption

